Subject: [PATCH] EDEN_UP_AM_THREADS: Lichii #659: two extra AM service host threads (vi2/vdec/syncpt no longer wait behind vblank pacing), with Lichii's locks; threads start only with the switch

--- a/src/core/hle/service/am/am.cpp
+++ b/src/core/hle/service/am/am.cpp
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 // SPDX-FileCopyrightText: Copyright 2018 yuzu Emulator Project
 // SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
 
+#include "common/logging.h"
+#include "common/pe_switch.h"
 #include "core/hle/service/am/am.h"
 #include "core/hle/service/am/button_poller.h"
 #include "core/hle/service/am/event_observer.h"
